https://si.imgix.net/267ffe3e/uploads/origins/49238147-5680-4e92-8ddf-4332996c1f0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c98890af448fb56afc4369d071adc541, https://si.imgix.net/267ffe3e/uploads/origins/49238147-5680-4e92-8ddf-4332996c1f0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a53bd7e8dae86ec468c446614f2a0fc8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/267ffe3e/uploads/origins/49238147-5680-4e92-8ddf-4332996c1f0c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=901e26379e3dba99a2426abd3a94fec4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/306", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c1441e6d/uploads/origins/5c8fd4a7-d2b3-48c9-8bc1-1cd152b0efba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a529e6d98711b830ad672f1d59682bc0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c1441e6d/uploads/origins/5c8fd4a7-d2b3-48c9-8bc1-1cd152b0efba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a529e6d98711b830ad672f1d59682bc0, https://si.imgix.net/c1441e6d/uploads/origins/5c8fd4a7-d2b3-48c9-8bc1-1cd152b0efba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6776731a88d18658d895e1ebcf5bca35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c1441e6d/uploads/origins/5c8fd4a7-d2b3-48c9-8bc1-1cd152b0efba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4e0541f3312e27936be8d5a7dc6f00a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ててぽさん、はじめまして。\n\n以下の設定のキャラをお願いできますでしょうか?\n\nイメージ:\n黒髪巨乳、おっとり天然、母性的なOL。\n年下の可愛い男が好き。\n可愛い新人君(男)の教育係設定。\n\n胸の大きさや体型は以前描かれていた以下の様にドスケベ希望。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@rakupote/works/297\n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/305", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/89580a2a/uploads/origins/ea636c15-913d-4308-986b-f34201631efb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a82ecbb5f717582a3b436c86ef0e8b8a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/89580a2a/uploads/origins/ea636c15-913d-4308-986b-f34201631efb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a82ecbb5f717582a3b436c86ef0e8b8a, https://si.imgix.net/89580a2a/uploads/origins/ea636c15-913d-4308-986b-f34201631efb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3c0a83c003dd1ad3240f79d1328659c5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/89580a2a/uploads/origins/ea636c15-913d-4308-986b-f34201631efb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4c3b4448106ce08cb3c77eb18909c27 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "いつも素敵なおっぱいイラストありがとうございます！\n\nもしよければ、またうちの子の八重櫻楓を描いて頂けないでしょうか？\nちょっと恥ずかしげにおっぱい強調してる様子だと嬉しいです\n\nぜひご検討よろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://x.com/amasakura_/status/1844706140598477125?s=46&t=pffGfh-GvV3KGaaB38vsog", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/304", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1654d7ac/uploads/origins/df76a030-9e04-439b-b30e-c0598309867f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7136cd931d221fc881ebf379558f345", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1654d7ac/uploads/origins/df76a030-9e04-439b-b30e-c0598309867f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7136cd931d221fc881ebf379558f345, https://si.imgix.net/1654d7ac/uploads/origins/df76a030-9e04-439b-b30e-c0598309867f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b4ec12b53c6a1bde6c1e6755ee08ddc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1654d7ac/uploads/origins/df76a030-9e04-439b-b30e-c0598309867f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bcc0275e1ae32ab77982f5c0be69e1a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nメイド服から胸がこぼれる蛇を描いてもらえますか？\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15f7grjsnlB430WqtU39WFcD-JxALGmiR?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/303", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b26d2701/uploads/origins/7caa9d4a-eddb-43d2-aaaf-e4ff62d20e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72c846ad8be82c1afbb3964d91d1fb30", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b26d2701/uploads/origins/7caa9d4a-eddb-43d2-aaaf-e4ff62d20e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72c846ad8be82c1afbb3964d91d1fb30, https://si.imgix.net/b26d2701/uploads/origins/7caa9d4a-eddb-43d2-aaaf-e4ff62d20e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed655eb7c2d023cc061730c32ae4243f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b26d2701/uploads/origins/7caa9d4a-eddb-43d2-aaaf-e4ff62d20e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f87fb74628fe90ec137428e635e3ac7a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！私のキツネ、カーラを描いていただけませんか？彼女の参考文献はこちら：https://refsheet.net/heh/kara\n\n彼女のビキニ姿を描いてください！体型はこれに近いものでお願いします。https://refsheet.net/media/4481b04999a2dfe6。細かいことはお任せします。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/302", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cff1eab2/uploads/origins/48a7b4ee-fed4-47e2-a911-a3b69617f665?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d284b5e0c8e02077caefa573e09d2306", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cff1eab2/uploads/origins/48a7b4ee-fed4-47e2-a911-a3b69617f665?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d284b5e0c8e02077caefa573e09d2306, https://si.imgix.net/cff1eab2/uploads/origins/48a7b4ee-fed4-47e2-a911-a3b69617f665?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97aa54d3942608952732e33de8cb623c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cff1eab2/uploads/origins/48a7b4ee-fed4-47e2-a911-a3b69617f665?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7a56c60e3e3120d10a9b29a1024fb97 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "うちの子の「乃亞」の水着イラストをお願いします。\n参考画像\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1jJqwADAFkVAf0jr-JAFu8xTVNxteJcI0/view?usp=sharing\n\n水着はビキニタイプでおっぱいは水着からこぼれそうなくらい大きめでお願いします。\n小悪魔っぽい笑顔でお願いしたいです。\n\n以上となります。\nよろしければご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/301", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a706451c/uploads/origins/00116ec3-cd9b-45f8-bf61-34f4547fe300?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=52c8d4ed3e24751049d1c258f50cb092", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a706451c/uploads/origins/00116ec3-cd9b-45f8-bf61-34f4547fe300?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=52c8d4ed3e24751049d1c258f50cb092, https://si.imgix.net/a706451c/uploads/origins/00116ec3-cd9b-45f8-bf61-34f4547fe300?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fa1b01665cf19e153ab6ca8de31efd9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a706451c/uploads/origins/00116ec3-cd9b-45f8-bf61-34f4547fe300?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bba4337fb9c318885af97ae4933ea7fc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rakupote/works/300", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/67633bcc/uploads/origins/c8d4d6df-a233-4bb9-9370-e2c657c2eeb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=